use show, clear, report from benson

-- The Shrine (ADR 0084). It owns its footprint's Surface Region, and its
-- grounds' climbs here too, so `the target` says which region was told.

-- The player came into the grounds. The footprint lies inside them, so
-- arriving there was already told.
on arrived
  if the target is me then return
  ask world to fixed "energy crystal"
  if it then
    show "THE SHRINE IS AT PEACE" and wait
  else
    show "A SHRINE STANDS HERE" and wait
  end if
end arrived

-- An object was left here. In the grounds, outside the Shrine, it is no
-- concern of the Shrine's. The energy crystal is taken as an offering and
-- fixed where it lies, so it can't be left twice.
on received item
  if the target is not me then return
  if item = "energy crystal" then
    ask world to fix item
    report ["THE SHRINE", "ACCEPTS THE CRYSTAL", "IT WILL NOT BE MOVED"] and wait
    clear and wait
    return
  end if
  show "THE SHRINE IS INDIFFERENT" and wait
end received
